    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "prefer use of `bufadd()` when editing a new dir.lua buf [here](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40738/changes/BASE..ea5614982e9f48137066b1131ef75b91c015233a#diff-79064f23958caeba7843939f4bac377b1de380bd69fc48e514ccdf275161e140R28)\n\ncan trigger re-parsing rather than preserve the original name of the directory buffer that we (I) spent so long trying to make work",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-22T17:49:27Z",
    "closed_by": {
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62671086?v=4",
