    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "It's not a hard requirement, only a question. If it causes a problem then we don't need to do it. The purpose (if any) of suggesting `bufadd()`  is to avoid problems with special chars. If the `edit ...{magic=false}` approach works for all kinds of chars, then there is no reason to use `bufadd()`\n\nWe can just be aware of this and reconsider if we run into cases where special chars cause trouble.",
            "created_at": "2026-07-22T16:33:58Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/40909#issuecomment-5048794767",
